  "question": {
    "text": "<p>. Match List I with List II :</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List I (Reagents used)</td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List II (Compound with Functional group detected)</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A.</td>\t\t\t<td>Alkaline solution of copper sulphate and sodium citrate</td>\t\t\t<td>I.</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"assets\\qt0043_fae13b9b4ddf.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 124px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B.</td>\t\t\t<td>Neutral <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> solution</td>\t\t\t<td>II.</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"assets\\qt0043_e6de32cd3563.png\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 87px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C.</td>\t\t\t<td>Alkaline chloroform solution</td>\t\t\t<td>III.</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"assets\\qt0043_aed444363811.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 90px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D.</td>\t\t\t<td>Potassium iodide and sodium hypochloride</td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"assets\\qt0043_39c9af713059.png\" style=\"width: 188px; height: 111px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>"
  },
